    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="970b1630-4df6-5594-bf86-f5f525ec8416" activityNameId="add02cf3-df9e-5576-9301-2d2db68de37d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity mix, electric utility Obwalden, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity mix, electric utility Obwalden, at plant
The technology shares in the production mix are based on the electricity declaration of the electric utility Obwalden in 2013. Electricity production from hydropower, biomass and nuclear power plants is further divided into specific technologies based on the Swiss electricity consumption mix in the year 2009.;
UUID: c4a7d825-6b6c-3dcb-89de-2d64882db7f6
Included are the technology shares of the electricity production at the electric utility Obwalden at the busbar. Not included are transformation, transport or distribution losses.
Location: Data apply to the supply area of the electric utility Obwalden.
Technology: Average technology per energy carrier.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Electricity declaration of the electric utility Obwalden. 
Extrapolations: Electricity production from hydropower, biomass and nuclear power plants is further divided into specific technologies based on the Swiss electricity production mix in the year 2011.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c4a7d825-6b6c-3dcb-89de-2d64882db7f6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
